flowchart LR
  D[Discover] --> I[Identity/fingerprint]
  I --> M[Metadata + format probe]
  M --> T[Bounded displayed thumbnail]
  T --> C[0/90/180/270 candidates]
  C --> F[Face/landmark inference]
  F --> E[Features + calibration]
  E --> P[Decision/abstention policy]
  P --> PLAN[Immutable sealed plan]
  PLAN --> PREF[Apply preflight]
  PREF --> X[Transform + metadata]
  X --> V[Independent verification]
  V --> J[Durable journal intent]
  J --> COMMIT[Safe-copy/atomic commit]
  COMMIT --> FINAL[Final verification + event]
